# The names that bind a held callable's actuals are those of the header of its
# declared type, p and q. The definition make3 returns names its formals x
# and y; those are not names of the call. A Frame whose head is no formal is
# an actual by place, here a call of an unknown y.
fn: make3 (int: n) fn: (int: p; int: q) int
    fn: f3 (int: x; int: y) int
        return: n + x * 10 + y
    return: f3
h3: make3 200
int: r h3(y: 2; x: 1)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
